@startuml entity_lantern_additions

package entity {
  class Entity {
    -- Added Fields --
    - lightRadius: int
    - currentLight: Entity

    -- Added Methods --
    + getCurrentLight(): Entity
    + setCurrentLight(currentLight: Entity): void
    + isLightSource(): boolean
    + getLightRadius(): int
    + getLightIntensity(): float
  }
}

package object {
  class ObjLantern {
    -- Lantern-specific --
    + ObjLantern(gameWindow: GameWindow)
    + setWorldX(x: int): void
    + setWorldY(y: int): void
    + isLightSource(): boolean
    + getLightRadius(): int
    + getLightIntensity(): float
  }
}

package player {
  class Player {
    -- Convenience methods --
    + getCurrentLight(): Entity
    + hasLantern(): boolean
    + getLanternRadius(): int
    + getLanternIntensity(): float
  }
}

package asset {
  class AssetSetter {
    + setObjLantern(): void
    - createObjLantern(worldX: int, worldY: int): ObjLantern
  }
}

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    + getObj(): Entity[]
    + repaint(): void
  }
}

object.ObjLantern --|> entity.Entity : extends
player.Player --> entity.Entity : currentLight (nullable)
asset.AssetSetter ..> object.ObjLantern : creates
asset.AssetSetter --> window.GameWindow : uses
window.GameWindow --> entity.Entity : manages (obj array)

note right of entity.Entity
**Notes**
Added for lantern support:
- 装備中の光源参照を保持する（currentLight）
- デフォルトでは光源ではない振る舞い（isLightSource() は false を返す）
- 光の半径と強度を取得するアクセサ（getLightRadius() / getLightIntensity()）

- store reference to equipped light source (currentLight)
- default non-light behavior: isLightSource() -> false
- accessors for light radius and intensity
end note

note right of object.ObjLantern
**Notes**
ObjLantern implements light-source behavior:
- isLightSource()、getLightRadius()、getLightIntensity() をオーバーライドする
- AssetSetter.setObjLantern() によって生成され、GameWindow.obj 配列に配置される

- overrides isLightSource(), getLightRadius(), getLightIntensity()
- created and placed into GameWindow.obj via AssetSetter.setObjLantern()
end note

@enduml